 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-idp140338796300736\" class=\"interactive-embedded-reading\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\">Link to Learning</div>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id1165070654580\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20240910.161227/resources/9c028f7bee59803317218797d0d7129d0afa03f1\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\">\n</span>\n\n<p id=\"fs-idp140338804817312\">To learn more about atoms, isotopes, and how to tell one isotope from another, run the simulation.<span data-type=\"newline\"><br></span>\n</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id1165071748010\" data-alt=\"atoms_isotopes\">\n<div class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\" data-type=\"switch\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/2-1-atoms-isotopes-ions-and-molecules-the-building-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" data-media=\"print\">Access multimedia content</a>\n<iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://openstax.org/l/atoms_isotopes\" class=\"os-is-iframe\" data-media=\"screen\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n                 </div>\n</div>",
